flowchart LR
    Proc["process in cgroup A<br/><b>does:</b> creates/connects TCP socket<br/><b>why next:</b> cgroup membership selects attached sock_ops programs<br/><b>state:</b> socket associated with cgroup"]
    Callback["sock_ops callback<br/><b>does:</b> runs at events such as TCP_CONNECT_CB or ACTIVE_ESTABLISHED_CB<br/><b>why next:</b> callback timing determines which socket options are still useful<br/><b>state:</b> bpf_sock_ops exposes skops fields and op code"]
    Policy["BPF policy lookup<br/><b>does:</b> reads cgroup/socket tuple or maps to choose tuning<br/><b>why next:</b> only matching sockets should be changed<br/><b>state:</b> desired TCP options or no-op"]
    SetOpt["bpf_setsockopt<br/><b>does:</b> changes allowed TCP/socket options before data path uses them<br/><b>why next:</b> TCP send path observes updated settings<br/><b>state:</b> nodelay/congestion-control/buffer option changed"]
    Send["TCP sends data<br/><b>does:</b> uses tuned socket state for later packets<br/><b>state:</b> policy applied per cgroup/socket"]

    Proc --> Callback --> Policy --> SetOpt --> Send

    classDef in fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef hot fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class Proc in
    class Callback,Policy,SetOpt hot
    class Send ok
